ildren_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"2三月，盜殺韓相俠累。俠累與濮陽嚴仲子有惡。仲子聞軹人聶政之勇，以黃金百溢爲政母壽，欲因以報仇。政不受，曰：「老母在，政身未敢以許人也！」及母卒，仲子乃使政刺俠累。俠累方坐府上，兵衞甚衆，聶政直入上階，刺殺俠累，因自皮面決眼，自屠出腸。韓人暴其尸於市，購問，莫能識。其姊嫈聞而往，哭之曰：「是軹深井里聶政也！以妾尚在之故，重自刑以絕從。妾柰何畏歿身之誅，終滅賢弟之名！」遂死於政尸之旁。","content_fanyi":"三月，强盗刺杀了韩国国相侠累。侠累与濮阳人严仲子有仇。严仲子听说轵邑人聂政勇敢，用一百镒黄金给聂政的母亲祝寿，想借他报仇。聂政不接受，说：“老母还在世，我聂政不敢把自身许诺给别人！”等到母亲去世后，严仲子就派聂政去刺杀侠累。侠累正坐在相府厅堂上，侍卫很多，聂政径直冲上台阶，杀死了侠累，然后自己割破脸皮、剜出眼睛，又剖腹拉出肠子而死。韩国人把他的尸体陈放在街市上示众，悬赏征求能辨认的人，但没有人能认出来。他的姐姐聂嫈听说后，赶往陈尸的街市，抚着尸体哭着说：“这是轵邑深井里的聂政啊！他因为我还在人世，就深深毁伤自己来断绝线索。我怎么能因为怕招来杀身之祸，就永远埋没贤弟的名声呢！”于是自杀，死在聂政尸体旁边。","content_jianti_auto":"2三月，盗杀韩相侠累。侠累与濮阳严仲子有恶。仲子闻轵人聂政之勇，以黄金百溢为政母寿，欲因以报仇。政不受，曰：「老母在，政身未敢以许人也！」及母卒，仲子乃使政刺侠累。侠累方坐府上，兵衞甚众，聂政直入上阶，刺杀侠累，因自皮面决眼，自屠出肠。韩人暴其尸于市，购问，莫能识。其姊嫈闻而往，哭之曰：「是轵深井里聂政也！以妾尚在之故，重自刑以绝从。妾柰何畏殁身之诛，终灭贤弟之名！」遂死于政尸之旁。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":42,"number":2,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一 (周紀一) / 安王 / 五年 / 第 2 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8bfb1542-db0e-11ef-a3f1-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-397},"tongjian_id":"8bfb1542-db0e-11ef-a3f1-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"鄒陽","people_name_jianti_auto":"邹阳","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8d671fc8-db0e-11ef-bae2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"荊軻","people_name_jianti_auto":"荆轲","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8d671fc9-db0e-11ef-a3da-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"應劭","people_name_jianti_auto":"应劭","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8d671fca-db0e-11ef-b871-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"荊軻","people_name_jianti_auto":"荆轲","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8d671fcb-db0e-11ef-ad23-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"秦王","people_name_jianti_auto":"秦王","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8d671fcc-db0e-11ef-88fe-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d671fcd-db0e-11ef-a170-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"燕","place_name_jianti_auto":"燕","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8d671fce-db0e-11ef-ae8d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢鄒陽曰：荊軻湛七族。應劭曰：荊軻爲燕刺秦王，其族坐之湛沒。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉邹阳曰：荆轲湛七族。应劭曰：荆轲为燕刺秦王，其族坐之湛没。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8d671fc7-db0e-11ef-984b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":133,"source_start_index":123,"source_text":"聶政事見一卷安王五年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8bfb1542-db0e-11ef-a3f1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"要離","people_name_jianti_auto":"要离","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd0-db0e-11ef-b223-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"吳王","people_name_jianti_auto":"吴王","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd1-db0e-11ef-8a0e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"闔閭","people_name_jianti_auto":"阖闾","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd2-db0e-11ef-8251-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"慶忌","people_name_jianti_auto":"庆忌","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd3-db0e-11ef-9fdb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"溫公","people_name_jianti_auto":"温公","start_index":94,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd4-db0e-11ef-be36-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd5-db0e-11ef-879d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":117,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd6-db0e-11ef-a5b5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"聶政","people_name_jianti_auto":"聂政","start_index":123,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd7-db0e-11ef-bd85-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"吳","place_name_jianti_auto":"吴","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd8-db0e-11ef-8900-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"關","place_name_jianti_auto":"关","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd9-db0e-11ef-9a54-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"8d671fda-db0e-11ef-8d28-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"8d671fdb-db0e-11ef-bcb9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","start_index":72,"tongjian_id":"8d671fdc-db0e-11ef-9369-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"8d671fdd-db0e-11ef-854d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"要離，吳人，爲吳王闔閭刺慶忌。言其力不足，譬如蜘蛛之螫毒於人而靡死耳。靡，披靡而死也。爾雅疏：鼅鼄，卽鼄蝥。方言：自關以西，秦、晉之間謂之鼄蝥，趙、魏之間謂之鼅鼄。蛛，音朱；蝥，音矛。靡，溫公揚子註，音如字。康：美爲切，謂糜爛也。余謂康音義俱非。聶政事見一卷安王五年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"要离，吴人，为吴王阖闾刺庆忌。言其力不足，譬如蜘蛛之螫毒于人而靡死耳。靡，披靡而死也。尔雅疏：鼅鼄，即鼄蝥。方言：自关以西，秦、晋之间谓之鼄蝥，赵、魏之间谓之鼅鼄。蛛，音朱；蝥，音矛。靡，温公扬子注，音如字。康：美为切，谓糜烂也。余谓康音义俱非。聂政事见一卷安王五年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"8d671fcf-db0e-11ef-ad9c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"吳祕","people_name_jianti_auto":"吴秘","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d671fe2-db0e-11ef-9339-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"荊軻","people_name_jianti_auto":"荆轲","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8d671fe3-db0e-11ef-b603-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"吳祕曰：荊軻，以君子之道類之則盜爾。","note_content_jianti_auto":"吴秘曰：荆轲，以君子之道类之则盗尔。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"8d671fe1-db0e-11ef-91f8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-397,"link_td_description":"聂政，战国轵邑（今日河南省济源市轹城镇）人，是战国时期刺客与音乐家，其事迹主要出自于《史记·刺客列传》。","link_td_id":"Q10009102","link_td_number_id":523601,"people_name":"聶政","people_name_jianti_auto":"聂政","people_xingming":"聂政","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"8d671fe7-db0e-11ef-a546-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"荊軻懷其豢養之私，不顧七族，欲以尺八匕首強燕而弱秦，不亦愚乎！故揚子論之，以要離爲蛛蝥之靡，聶政爲壯士之靡，荊軻爲刺客之靡，皆不可謂之義。又曰：「荊軻，君子盜諸。」善哉！","content_fanyi":"荆轲感怀燕太子姬丹豢养的私恩，竟不顾七族亲属都会受到牵连，想凭一尺八寸的短匕首使燕国强盛、秦国削弱，这难道不是愚蠢至极吗！所以扬雄评论此事说，要离的死属于蜘蛛、毒虫一类，聂政的死属于壮士一类，荆轲的死属于刺客一类，这些人都不能称为义士。扬雄又说：“荆轲，从君子的道德观念来看，不过是个大盗贼罢了。”这话说得多好啊！","content_jianti_auto":"荆轲怀其豢养之私，不顾七族，欲以尺八匕首强燕而弱秦，不亦愚乎！故扬子论之，以要离为蛛蝥之靡，聂政为壮士之靡，荆轲为刺客之靡，皆不可谓之义。又曰：「荆轲，君子盗诸。」善哉！","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":543,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第七 (秦紀二) / 始皇帝下 / 二十五年 / 第 5 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8d671fc6-db0e-11ef-b225-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-222},"tongjian_id":"8d671fc6-db0e-11ef-b225-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2}],"page_size":7,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":2},"profile":{"alias_list":[],"biography":"聂政，战国轵邑（今日河南省济源市轹城镇）人，是战国时期刺客与音乐家，其事迹主要出自于《史记·刺客列传》。","death_year":-397,"link_td_id":"Q10009102","name":"聂政","number_id":523601},"relationships":[{"direction":"reverse","rank":"normal","relation_detail":"聂嫈是聂政的姐姐，来源文本：是戰國 (中国)(戰國时期)著名的刺客聶政的姐姐。","relation_property_display_template":"{subject}的兄弟姐妹是{value}","relation_property_id":"P100028","relation_property_label":"兄弟姐妹","source_person_id":"Q10005260","source_person_name":"聂嫈","source_person_number_id":5498919,"statement_id":"S-Q10005260-P100028-Q10009102","target_person_id":"Q10009102","target_person_name":"聂政","target_person_number_id":523601},{"direction":"forward","rank":"normal","relation_detail":"聂政的姐姐，来源文本：|兄弟姊妹=聶嫈","relation_property_display_template":"{subject}的兄弟姐妹是{value}","relation_property_id":"P100028","relation_property_label":"兄弟姐妹","source_person_id":"Q10009102","source_person_name":"聂政","source_person_number_id":523601,"statement_id":"S-Q10009102-P100028-Q10005260"